wayfinder skill and the local Wayfinder service, or Matt Pocock's original skills keeping
Maps as local Markdown. One command also runs the service, the ChatGPT test connection and
the Map and session listings. See README.md in this directory.

Standard library only, Python 3.9+, so it starts from any shell without a virtualenv.
"""
